# Browser
# Bot1 casts Pyrrhic Strike in the browser. The optional blight is asked first, each option saying how many modes it
# leaves ("choose one", "choose both"), because whether it is paid decides that (CR 601.2b, 700.2). Paid, the modes
# question says "choose both" and wants two; the creature to blight is captioned as a blight, not a keep. Bot1's
# Endurance takes the two -1/-1 counters, and Bot2's Sol Ring and Hero of Bladehold are destroyed.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Sol Ring
Black Lotus
Endurance
Pyrrhic Strike
Plains x2
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Black Lotus
Sol Ring
Hero of Bladehold
Island x2
Island x20

